export anchor TactileKnobsStyle:
    number: 381
    screen: SmartHome
    name: Tactile knobs
    idea: The home as a wall of brushed metal faceplates, each room a screwed module with real looking rotary knobs, toggle switches, lit lamps and amber readouts, and scenes are chunky push buttons that stay pressed in.
    base: dark
    palette:
        page: #161719, rack ground with fine brushed lines
        plate: #24262a, faceplates, from #2b2e33 at top to #202226
        plate2: #2c2f34, list rows and knob caps
        edge: #0c0d0e, plate edges and button outlines
        hi: #3d4148, top bevel highlight
        ink: #eceae4, text and switch labels
        mute: #aeb0b4, engraved labels and meta
        lcd: #0b0a06, readout windows and the LED matrix
        amber: #ffb84a, readouts, lit ticks, pointers, pressed scene, focus, primary
        onAmber: #2a1700, text on amber
        lamp: #ff6a4d, warning lamp, motion lamp, top matrix cells
        green: #7fe08a, locked lamp and key
    type:
        Condensed labels, Bahnschrift, DIN Alternate, Roboto Condensed,
        Arial Narrow, base 15px. Engraved plate labels 13px at 700 caps with
        0.2em tracking and a dark top text shadow. Readouts use ui-
        monospace, SF Mono, Menlo at 26px, 600 in amber inside black
        windows. Unit labels 12px caps 0.14em.
    layout:
        A brushed dark metal rack with fine horizontal lines holds a 6
        column panel of screwed faceplates, each with two corner screws, a
        top bevel and a raised shadow. A header plate names Brightwork Home
        and Main panel with an amber readout of the day and time. A warning
        plate has a glowing red lamp with a triangle, Garage door open, 2
        hours, and a raised amber Close now. The living room plate holds an
        amber temperature readout, a knurled rotary dimmer at 40 percent
        with lit amber ticks and pointer, a toggle switch up with a round
        amber lamp for 3 lights on, and a toggle down with a dark lamp for
        TV off. The kitchen plate has its readout and a toggle down for
        lights off. The bedroom plate has a thermostat knob at 19 and a
        readout showing the switch to 18. The front door plate has a key
        switch turned to lock with a square green lamp and Locked. The
        garden plate shows the last event time and a triangle red lamp for
        Motion. Scenes are four chunky push buttons, Movie sunk 3px with an
        inner shadow, amber text and a down arrow In. A full width energy
        plate shows readouts for used and solar, a small battery knob at 64
        percent and an LED matrix of 24 columns, each lit cell 0.2 kWh,
        amber with red top cells. Below 1060px plates regroup, and at phone
        width they stack.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 12px between plates, 20 to 22px plate padding.
    density: Medium. Each room shows its physical controls rather than a summary.
    corners: 6px plates and buttons, 3px readouts, round knobs and screws.
    borders: A 1px near black plate edge with a 1px #3d4148 top bevel highlight.
    shadows:
        Raised plates use 0 3px 6px black, buttons sit on a 3 to 4px dark
        ledge, and a pressed button sinks 3px with an inner shadow.
    icons:
        Line icons at 2px stroke on push buttons. States use lamp shapes, a
        round amber lamp for on, a square green lamp for locked and a
        triangle red lamp for motion, each beside a word.
    focus: A 3px amber outline offset 3px.
    tone: Engraved caps nouns, such as MAIN PANEL, DIM 40%, HEAT SCHEDULE and IN.
